qsar:ProfilerOutput a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Profiler dataset type"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Preliminary defined categories (functional groups/alerts) used in a profiler."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ssbd:Dataset ;
    skos:scopeNote """Profiler definition: The profilers identify the affiliation of the target chemical(s) to preliminary defined categories (functional groups/alerts). The outcome of the profiling determines the most appropriate way to search for analogues, but they are also useful for preliminary screening or prioritization of substances. 

The profilers are not (Q)SAR models. Hence, the profiling results are not a predictions and should not be used as such. see https://qsartoolbox.org/features/profiling/
https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2468111325000167 


QSAR profiler categories are from the QSARToolbox: https://qsartoolbox.org/resources/profilers/""" .

